In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires -
"the Board" means the Employees' Trust Fund Board established by the principal enactment;
"the Fund" means the Employees' Trust Fund established by the principal enactment;
" Higher Educational Institution" has the same meaning as in the Universities Act, No. 16 of
1978;
"principal enactment" means the Employees Trust Fund Act, No. 46 of 1980;
"University Grants Commission" means the University Grants Commission established by
the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978.
